  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Finansiering f&#xf6;r colombianska ungdomsrepresentanters deltagande i konferensen EVAC, Ending Violence Against Children, 7-8 november 2024, Bogot&#xe1; Colombia. EVAC konferensen &#xe4;r den f&#xf6;rsta globala ministerkonferensen med syfte att st&#xe4;vja v&#xe5;ld mot barn, i linje med SDG-m&#xe5;let att skydda och eliminera v&#xe5;ld mot barn.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding for Colombian youth representatives&apos; participation in the EVAC Conference, Ending Violence Against Children, November 7-8, 2024, Bogot&#xe1;, Colombia. The EVAC Conference is the first global ministerial conference aimed at combating violence against children, in line with the Sustainable Development Goal (SDG) to protect and eliminate violence against children.</narrative>
  </description>
